        "TileImage": "$($repository 427e3109-2bd2-4453-91dc-8eef1203ea42).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rA dangerous corporate leader is being called upon the Liberation&apos;s anual party in Bangkok. He&apos;s tied to different events occuring before Owen&apos;s assassination, and was a close friend of his. Turns out, 2 of his security personel were tested, and they were, in fact, infected.\r\rI belive, since he is tied to Owen, that maybe we could get helpful information to track the traitors down.\r\rThis may be the actual last time we face the Nabazov virus. \r\rI will leave you, to prepare.",
